{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/15881-deva-corporation","id":15881,"title":"Deva Corporation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T21:56:25-08:00","id":15881,"title":"Deva Corporation","content":"So, do you interpret the Deva Corporation from DtD as being a Hunter Conspiracy? Presumably with God-Machine based tech as their Endowment?<br /> <br /> I'm a little torn, mainly because that was what I was going to do for the Chinese Government's Hunter Conspiracy - the Xuanmiao Ministry employing God Machine based tech to capture and condition supernaturals as their agents. I suppose we'll see if Monstrous Bastards includes a new DtD-themed/focused Conspiracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T22:28:21-08:00","id":15893,"title":"","content":"I believe we're getting &quot;servants of the God-Machine who can do things like punch a Demon out of Cover.&quot; No detail beyond that.<br /> <br /> I see them as too thematically similar to the Cheiron Group for Hunter use; both are corporations with vast resources that dissect the supernatural for understanding and power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T22:59:37-08:00","id":15908,"title":"","content":"But they're not really &quot;servants&quot; of the God Machine. I mean, sometimes they knowingly do things the God Machine wants, but they're trying to harness it, not serve its ends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T00:16:30-08:00","id":15930,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Knights_of_Saint_George\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Knights_of_Saint_George</a><br /> <br /> Faceless angels + Hunters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T00:37:18-08:00","id":15940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jesuncolo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/15881-deva-corporation?p=15930#post15930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Knights_of_Saint_George\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Knights_of_Saint_George</a><br /> <br /> Faceless angels + Hunters.</div> </div> </div> </div>... who have absolutely nothing to do with the Deva Corporation or the God Machine... the Faceless Angels are pretty explicitly Abyss entities... so I'm not quite sure why you're bringing them up. Am I missing something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T02:08:25-08:00","id":15989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/15881-deva-corporation#post15881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, do you interpret the Deva Corporation from DtD as being a Hunter Conspiracy? Presumably with God-Machine based tech as their Endowment?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes, yes I do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/15881-deva-corporation#post15881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a little torn, mainly because that was what I was going to do for the Chinese Government's Hunter Conspiracy - the Xuanmiao Ministry employing God Machine based tech to capture and condition supernaturals as their agents. I suppose we'll see if Monstrous Bastards includes a new DtD-themed/focused Conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, great minds think alike. I was also thinking of the Chinese government. I didn't give them G-M tech though.<br /> <br /> My idea was to make them thematically &quot;The Man&quot;. Playing off on China's central government control, censorship, etc. This makes them thematic foils to the Unchained. The Man vs Rebels. They can offer a Demon shelter, resources and cover if they see a benefit but just as easily elimate a demon who's causing trouble. Same with the G-M they can work together for mutual benefit or they can oppose it where their goals differ. Most of their goals would be based around improving the economy, with monster hunting being a sideline when it helps the long term forecast.<br /> <br /> For their Endowment I was going to give them predictive mathematics. The cool thing about this is that playing them means that you're kinda playing the G-M itself. Ordering around teams of agents to do stuff that rube-goldbergs it's way to achieving your aims. Plus, an Endowment that lets you say &quot;I knew you would jump there, so I put a landmine there yesterday&quot; is pretty awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T09:13:13-08:00","id":16129,"title":"","content":"Wait what about Dynasty International? They are the Conspiracy Corporation for Mummies, why don't they get a thread!?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T11:07:36-08:00","id":16188,"title":"","content":"LDI got mentioned quite a few times on the old forums. However, they seem to be a weird mix of Cheiron Group, Ascending Ones, and Aegis Kai Doru. Although The Golden Vial Ritual appears to be a copy of the Rite of Hecate replacing the Mage with a Mummy and being somewhat survivable. Huh, looks like its already set to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}